AUTH-004 | Authentication & Security | Password reset | Functional | MISSING | No PasswordResetConfirm implementation or password-reset templates were found. | Implement secure password-reset confirmation workflow and required templates.

AUTH-005 | Authentication & Security | Change password | Functional | COMPLETE | PasswordChangeView verifies current password, validates new password, changes password, rotates token_version, and records an audit event. | No major functional gap identified from current inspection.

